ee different characters. Each one has unique parameters to shake up the gameplay.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Gearbits intergration!</h2><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2804580/extras/4000167a8ca3e67d9ff1bd3e0e25a33b.poster.avif?t=1708949534\" width=600 height=182 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2804580/extras/4000167a8ca3e67d9ff1bd3e0e25a33b.webm?t=1708949534\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2804580/extras/4000167a8ca3e67d9ff1bd3e0e25a33b.mp4?t=1708949534\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>After successfully clearing the game, you can transfer your save file, to unlock new characters in Gearbits.",
